  q(IT,'Two-factor authentication requires users to provide:','Two different kinds of proof',['Two passwords of any kind','A password typed twice','Two supervisors to sign'],'D','Factors include something you know, something you have and something you are, such as a fingerprint.',AAMI),
  q(IT,'Which law protects the privacy and security of patient health information?','HIPAA',['OSHA','CLIA','EMTALA'],'A','The HIPAA Security Rule requires safeguards for electronic health data, including data in devices.',AAMI),
  q(IT,'What is a VLAN?','A logical network segment',['A wireless power charger','A type of virus scanner','A cable tester tool'],'B','VLANs separate traffic on shared switches, so medical devices can be isolated from other systems.',AAMI)
